1
00:00:01,783 --> 00:00:05,029
Over the mountains and through the valleys

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:08,596
A ninja flies freely in the sky like an airplane

3
00:00:08,848 --> 00:00:12,281
Upright and kind, Hattori-kun brings joy to all

4
00:00:12,435 --> 00:00:15,615
Eyes wide open, little mouth shut tight

5
00:00:15,948 --> 00:00:19,349
Hiding his face behind a mask, cheeks puffed up

6
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:22,673
Catching villains with agile moves, fast as lightning

7
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:26,440
Catching bad guys with quirky new tricks like magic

8
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:34,033
"Sports Day Is the Worst"

9
00:00:41,109 --> 00:00:42,161
What's going on?

10
00:00:42,202 --> 00:00:44,462
I smelled fried food from outside

11
00:00:44,777 --> 00:00:46,250
You've got quite a sharp nose!

12
00:00:46,291 --> 00:00:47,944
Kenichi has sports day tomorrow

13
00:00:47,984 --> 00:00:49,077
so I made some fried shrimp

14
00:00:49,118 --> 00:00:52,117
- And sushi for everyone
- Yay, I love fried shrimp!

15
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:54,830
- Yay... I love it!
- I like it too... Yay...

16
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:57,143
In that case, I'll make some more

17
00:00:57,190 --> 00:00:57,948
- Wow, yay!
- Wow, yay!

18
00:00:57,989 --> 00:01:00,867
- So happy, yay...
- So happy...

19
00:01:01,379 --> 00:01:02,178
Shishimaru

20
00:01:02,218 --> 00:01:03,850
Let's pray for good weather tomorrow, okay?

21
00:01:03,891 --> 00:01:05,562
The weather will definitely be good

22
00:01:06,037 --> 00:01:08,620
Shinzo, don't wish for good weather tomorrow

23
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:09,954
Pray for rain!

24
00:01:10,312 --> 00:01:12,711
If it rains, won't sports day be canceled?

25
00:01:12,752 --> 00:01:14,533
It'd be great if it's canceled

26
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:16,427
Kenichi

27
00:01:16,467 --> 00:01:18,782
You don't like sports day?

28
00:01:18,823 --> 00:01:19,836
What's so good about it?

29
00:01:19,877 --> 00:01:21,399
Why don't you like it?

30
00:01:22,731 --> 00:01:24,797
If I could run as fast as you, Hattori-kun

31
00:01:24,838 --> 00:01:26,442
how could I not like it?

32
00:01:26,815 --> 00:01:29,822
The problem is I come in dead last in races every single time

33
00:01:29,872 --> 00:01:31,685
As long as you do well in school, that's fine

34
00:01:31,726 --> 00:01:32,986
- Yeah...
- Yeah...

35
00:01:33,302 --> 00:01:34,850
Too bad I'm not good at studying either

36
00:01:34,890 --> 00:01:37,865
You mean
you also come in last on tests?

37
00:01:38,266 --> 00:01:39,433
Do I really need to spell it out?

38
00:01:39,473 --> 00:01:40,557
I'm so sorry

39
00:01:40,947 --> 00:01:42,400
It'd be great if it rained tomorrow

40
00:01:42,441 --> 00:01:45,027
Big Brother, can you help Kenichi train harder?

41
00:01:45,430 --> 00:01:47,530
Train harder? Then can I run faster?

42
00:01:47,570 --> 00:01:48,910
Actually, as ninjas

43
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:50,769
we weren't born fast runners either

44
00:01:50,810 --> 00:01:52,056
First...

45
00:01:52,432 --> 00:01:54,063
I had to train myself

46
00:01:54,103 --> 00:01:56,663
so the cloth wouldn't touch the ground when I ran

47
00:01:56,737 --> 00:01:58,383
Yan...

48
00:02:00,095 --> 00:02:01,516
Next, raising the bar

49
00:02:01,557 --> 00:02:03,697
even when wet, the cloth must not touch the ground

50
00:02:05,233 --> 00:02:06,647
Is that for real?

51
00:02:06,886 --> 00:02:08,340
If I suddenly run that fast

52
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:10,555
it'll totally freak out my classmates!

53
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:15,567
Kenichi is so amazing!

54
00:02:17,710 --> 00:02:19,306
Alright, I'm going to train my skills!

55
00:02:19,346 --> 00:02:20,758
Hattori-kun, teach me!

56
00:02:20,832 --> 00:02:22,420
Though training for just one day...

57
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:23,800
I doubt it'll be of much use?

58
00:02:23,850 --> 00:02:25,887
Big Brother, since Kenichi is so determined

59
00:02:25,928 --> 00:02:27,874
you should definitely find a way to help him

60
00:02:27,915 --> 00:02:30,194
Actually, your motive isn't to help Kenichi

61
00:02:30,235 --> 00:02:31,901
You just want fried shrimp, don't you?

62
00:02:32,625 --> 00:02:34,030
You saw right through me

63
00:02:39,178 --> 00:02:40,707
All right, let's begin

64
00:02:40,821 --> 00:02:43,999
So I just run as fast as I can, and keep the cloth off the ground, right?

66
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,187
Exactly, that's it

67
00:02:45,234 --> 00:02:46,100
All right

68
00:02:47,811 --> 00:02:49,673
Yan...

69
00:02:56,865 --> 00:02:57,600
Yan...

70
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:59,612
Kenichi, run as fast as you can!

71
00:03:00,239 --> 00:03:02,385
You can't be this slow! Hurry up

72
00:03:02,425 --> 00:03:05,056
- I don't want to be this slow either!
- Yan...

73
00:03:13,378 --> 00:03:15,091
I think the cloth is too long

74
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:17,317
Then I'll cut it shorter

75
00:03:22,593 --> 00:03:23,473
Kenichi!

76
00:03:23,513 --> 00:03:26,359
- You need to be faster!
- The cloth hasn't even left the ground once!

77
00:03:29,298 --> 00:03:31,524
Great, now the cloth is floating!

78
00:03:31,565 --> 00:03:33,380
It's so short, of course it's off the ground!

79
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:35,278
Kenichi, stop and look

80
00:03:38,626 --> 00:03:40,820
Actually, it's just the wind blowing your cloth up

81
00:03:42,336 --> 00:03:44,350
Oh right, I forgot one thing

82
00:03:44,391 --> 00:03:45,357
What is it?

83
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:48,220
Everyone needs talent for whatever they do

84
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,759
Without that talent

85
00:03:49,799 --> 00:03:51,379
No amount of hard practice will help

86
00:03:51,419 --> 00:03:54,080
Hattori-kun, are you saying I have no talent at all?

87
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,580
But on the other hand

88
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:58,272
The human body has latent potential, so under special circumstances

89
00:03:58,312 --> 00:04:01,488
This inner power can often be triggered instantly

90
00:04:01,528 --> 00:04:02,748
How do you unleash it?

91
00:04:02,789 --> 00:04:04,414
It's actually very simple

92
00:04:10,286 --> 00:04:12,319
Help...

93
00:04:12,573 --> 00:04:14,729
Help!

94
00:04:16,686 --> 00:04:18,580
You said everyone has inner power

95
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,932
Where's mine?

96
00:04:19,973 --> 00:04:22,198
Someone as weak as you is truly rare

97
00:04:22,239 --> 00:04:24,580
To think there's someone with no inner power at all

98
00:04:25,597 --> 00:04:28,567
If... if it rains tomorrow, that would be great

99
00:04:39,794 --> 00:04:42,035
Brother, a kid who hates sports as much as Kenichi

100
00:04:42,075 --> 00:04:44,420
is really rare, I've never seen one before

101
00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:46,281
Actually, Kenichi doesn't hate sports

102
00:04:46,321 --> 00:04:47,443
He just wants to show off too much

103
00:04:47,484 --> 00:04:48,837
Because he's afraid he won't get first place

104
00:04:48,877 --> 00:04:50,274
That's why he hates sports?

105
00:04:50,315 --> 00:04:52,754
If you don't care about winning, sports are pure enjoyment

106
00:04:52,795 --> 00:04:55,968
Still, I really want to help Kenichi win first place

107
00:04:56,009 --> 00:04:57,181
Really

108
00:05:05,289 --> 00:05:07,180
This is so delicious!

109
00:05:08,221 --> 00:05:10,036
The next event is the boys' 100-meter dash

110
00:05:10,077 --> 00:05:12,136
Now it's Kenichi's group's turn to race

111
00:05:12,686 --> 00:05:13,800
Ninja Concealment!

112
00:05:14,432 --> 00:05:16,480
All right, everyone get in position

113
00:05:18,637 --> 00:05:20,140
Well, sorry about this

114
00:05:20,181 --> 00:05:22,360
When it comes to running, no one can beat me

115
00:05:22,401 --> 00:05:24,074
Kemumaki is a ninja from the Koga clan

116
00:05:24,115 --> 00:05:25,340
Of course he runs fast

117
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,900
The other classmates might not be ninjas

118
00:05:26,940 --> 00:05:29,340
but they're still faster than me, this is terrible!

119
00:05:29,606 --> 00:05:31,073
On your mark

120
00:05:31,954 --> 00:05:32,781
Get set

121
00:05:40,041 --> 00:05:42,460
Beating them is a piece of cake

122
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:44,220
It's the Stumbling Stone Ninja Technique!

123
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:45,541
Wh-What's going on...

124
00:05:45,668 --> 00:05:47,388
I won't let you run!

125
00:05:47,429 --> 00:05:48,611
The Iga Clan, huh?

126
00:05:48,651 --> 00:05:50,419
Ninja Hattori-kun is too despicable!

127
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:52,667
I'll definitely get my revenge! I'm going to run!

128
00:06:00,444 --> 00:06:03,038
Kenichi, go for it!

129
00:06:03,110 --> 00:06:05,016
Artificial Hornet!

130
00:06:07,489 --> 00:06:09,922
A hornet... Help!

131
00:06:11,307 --> 00:06:13,607
It worked... Alright!

132
00:06:19,757 --> 00:06:20,891
Shinzo!

133
00:06:20,931 --> 00:06:23,142
You've gone too far!

134
00:06:28,370 --> 00:06:30,603
"Kenichi the Master Photographer"

135
00:06:38,348 --> 00:06:40,675
Wow, those persimmons look delicious!

136
00:06:41,287 --> 00:06:42,613
I really want to eat one

137
00:06:42,654 --> 00:06:43,580
Hey, what are you doing?

138
00:06:44,688 --> 00:06:46,120
I finally caught you!

139
00:06:46,317 --> 00:06:47,911
So you're the one who stole the persimmons!

140
00:06:47,952 --> 00:06:49,718
No, I didn't steal them! It wasn't me!

141
00:06:49,758 --> 00:06:51,229
I was just passing by!

142
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,531
Silence! Shut your mouth!

143
00:06:54,450 --> 00:06:56,462
How outrageous...

144
00:06:56,688 --> 00:06:59,300
Mister, it wasn't me! I have nothing to do with this!

145
00:06:59,341 --> 00:07:01,369
Aaia, help!

146
00:07:02,267 --> 00:07:04,539
Coming here every day to steal persimmons to eat?!

147
00:07:04,580 --> 00:07:06,748
How outrageous! I'll beat you to a pulp...

148
00:07:09,733 --> 00:07:11,619
Kenichi Mitsuba, stand up!

149
00:07:13,282 --> 00:07:14,222
Me?

150
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:16,112
I told you to stand up! Hurry up!

151
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,354
Yes, sir

152
00:07:17,690 --> 00:07:19,980
Kenichi, put your hand over your heart

153
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:22,723
Then think carefully about what happened yesterday afternoon

154
00:07:22,796 --> 00:07:24,040
Put my hand over my heart...

155
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:26,356
Yesterday afternoon, I was playing ball on the court

156
00:07:26,397 --> 00:07:27,740
After playing ball, I went home

157
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:30,043
Then I watched TV, right?

158
00:07:30,732 --> 00:07:32,220
Oh no, this is bad

159
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:34,020
That leftover sweet bun from watching TV last night

160
00:07:34,060 --> 00:07:35,865
I forgot to bring it today to eat!

161
00:07:37,924 --> 00:07:38,957
Silence!

162
00:07:39,210 --> 00:07:40,586
Is this cap yours?

163
00:07:40,723 --> 00:07:42,185
That's right, that cap is mine

164
00:07:42,226 --> 00:07:44,636
Turns out I left it at school yesterday and forgot to bring it home

165
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:47,201
This cap...

166
00:07:47,241 --> 00:07:48,748
was found under a persimmon tree

167
00:07:48,789 --> 00:07:50,121
Under a persimmon tree?

168
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:52,049
Oh no, this is bad...

169
00:07:52,090 --> 00:07:53,969
Kenichi, you finally remember, don't you?

170
00:07:54,010 --> 00:07:54,947
I heard that every day...

171
00:07:54,987 --> 00:07:56,641
you go to Old Man Sze's house to steal persimmons

172
00:07:56,681 --> 00:07:57,639
Is that true?

173
00:07:57,680 --> 00:08:00,339
No... I've never stolen persimmons!

174
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:01,785
Still making excuses?

175
00:08:01,826 --> 00:08:03,106
Stealing is a crime

176
00:08:03,146 --> 00:08:05,419
I'm definitely going to inform your parents

177
00:08:05,606 --> 00:08:07,301
Aaia, I didn't steal anything!

178
00:08:07,341 --> 00:08:09,386
Why do you insist on saying I stole them?

179
00:08:09,427 --> 00:08:11,383
The more I think about it, the more unfair it feels!

180
00:08:11,737 --> 00:08:12,510
Hey

181
00:08:12,615 --> 00:08:15,389
Kenichi, got scolded by the teacher today, didn't you?

182
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:16,704
Serves you right!

183
00:08:17,396 --> 00:08:19,390
Could it be you who stole them, Kemumaki?

184
00:08:20,157 --> 00:08:21,641
Hey... don't make wild accusations

185
00:08:21,681 --> 00:08:24,127
Actually, my Kagechiyo just stole them for me to eat

186
00:08:24,168 --> 00:08:25,846
Oh, he's so thoughtful

187
00:08:25,887 --> 00:08:26,861
You flatter me

188
00:08:26,914 --> 00:08:28,321
Here, have another one

189
00:08:28,421 --> 00:08:29,815
Thanks a lot

190
00:08:33,254 --> 00:08:35,874
Kenichi, I know you must be feeling really resentful

191
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:38,500
Kenichi, if you want to clear your name...

192
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:41,179
The best way is to find the real thief

193
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,094
That makes a lot of sense

194
00:08:46,324 --> 00:08:49,508
Wow, just looking at these persimmons makes my mouth water

195
00:08:49,549 --> 00:08:50,854
Hey, Hattori-kun

196
00:08:51,862 --> 00:08:53,137
I'm really sorry

197
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:55,793
Yan... Ouch...

198
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:57,621
Someone is coming this way

199
00:08:57,661 --> 00:08:59,301
Alright, let's hurry and hide

200
00:08:59,670 --> 00:09:01,430
Cloth Concealment Ninja Technique

201
00:09:04,703 --> 00:09:06,130
We're here...

202
00:09:06,170 --> 00:09:07,616
Sure enough, they've arrived

203
00:09:08,651 --> 00:09:10,311
Yeah... it's right here, huh?

204
00:09:10,489 --> 00:09:11,385
That's right

205
00:09:19,901 --> 00:09:21,681
-It hurts...
-It hurts...

206
00:09:21,936 --> 00:09:23,156
Great, caught you!

207
00:09:23,197 --> 00:09:24,568
Freeze, you two!

208
00:09:28,053 --> 00:09:30,550
So you two are the ones stealing persimmons?

209
00:09:30,757 --> 00:09:32,266
You're saying we stole persimmons?

210
00:09:32,306 --> 00:09:34,190
We haven't even started picking them

211
00:09:34,230 --> 00:09:35,050
Yeah, that's right

212
00:09:35,090 --> 00:09:36,853
What? Haven't started picking them?

213
00:09:36,894 --> 00:09:38,334
The first ninja commandment

214
00:09:38,374 --> 00:09:39,702
To become an excellent ninja...

215
00:09:39,742 --> 00:09:41,467
You must train your leg strength

216
00:09:41,514 --> 00:09:44,055
So we came out to practice running tonight as usual

217
00:09:44,095 --> 00:09:47,357
We just happened to pass by and noticed these persimmons look so good

218
00:09:47,461 --> 00:09:48,431
-Huh?
-Yeah

219
00:09:48,472 --> 00:09:50,385
Still, using ninja techniques to steal food...

220
00:09:50,425 --> 00:09:51,725
...is just wrong

221
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,430
I'm going to punish both of you

222
00:09:53,470 --> 00:09:55,033
Oh no, let's run!

223
00:09:55,074 --> 00:09:56,750
-Shinzo, Shishimaru, don't run!
-Hattori-kun!

224
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:59,794
Forget it, our main goal is catching the thief

225
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:01,841
Fool

226
00:10:03,417 --> 00:10:05,037
Fool...

227
00:10:05,556 --> 00:10:06,328
Fool...

228
00:10:06,369 --> 00:10:08,855
Oh, it's a crow stealing them!

229
00:10:13,492 --> 00:10:15,352
Oh no, let's get out of here!

230
00:10:19,707 --> 00:10:20,940
Here, take a look

231
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,995
This is the real persimmon thief

232
00:10:23,036 --> 00:10:24,269
Nice one, Kenichi

233
00:10:24,309 --> 00:10:27,567
Now we have photo evidence, that crow has nowhere to hide!

234
00:10:28,838 --> 00:10:30,162
Kenichi

235
00:10:31,348 --> 00:10:32,909
Look closely

236
00:10:33,522 --> 00:10:34,508
What is it?

237
00:10:34,958 --> 00:10:36,905
Oh, it's Kagechiyo!

238
00:10:37,058 --> 00:10:39,682
So he's the real thief, isn't he?

239
00:10:39,723 --> 00:10:41,010
Ah, that's right

240
00:10:41,050 --> 00:10:43,730
Turns out he's the real persimmon thief!

241
00:10:48,802 --> 00:10:50,511
Do you think Kagechiyo will come?

242
00:10:51,458 --> 00:10:52,578
He's coming

243
00:10:56,450 --> 00:10:58,562
Target acquired...

244
00:11:05,402 --> 00:11:07,104
These soft persimmons must be delicious

245
00:11:07,226 --> 00:11:08,308
Hurry up and take the photo!

246
00:11:16,543 --> 00:11:18,535
What a great shot!

247
00:11:19,577 --> 00:11:21,437
Please don't...

248
00:11:22,143 --> 00:11:23,257
It wasn't me...

249
00:11:23,852 --> 00:11:26,430
If you want solid proof, take a few more photos!

250
00:11:27,842 --> 00:11:29,088
Oh no, Kenichi!

251
00:11:29,129 --> 00:11:31,058
Kenichi, are you alright?

252
00:11:31,681 --> 00:11:33,292
Hey, what nerve!

253
00:11:34,627 --> 00:11:35,708
You little thief!

254
00:11:35,748 --> 00:11:37,370
Caught red-handed this time!

255
00:11:37,523 --> 00:11:39,050
No... It's got nothing to do with me!

256
00:11:39,091 --> 00:11:41,260
Still denying it? I'll beat you to a pulp!

257
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:43,072
Dense Smoke Ninja Technique

258
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:44,809
What... What is this...?

259
00:11:44,850 --> 00:11:46,234
Kenichi, hurry and run!

260
00:11:46,598 --> 00:11:48,273
Yan...

261
00:11:50,724 --> 00:11:52,264
Yan...

262
00:11:53,197 --> 00:11:54,484
Got you now!

263
00:11:56,112 --> 00:11:57,697
Take that, how dare you!

264
00:11:58,078 --> 00:12:00,807
Old man, this is the real thief!

265
00:12:03,046 --> 00:12:04,993
So this cat was the one stealing persimmons?

266
00:12:05,034 --> 00:12:06,623
That's exactly right!

267
00:12:09,183 --> 00:12:11,383
Agh, you've completely humiliated me!

268
00:12:11,424 --> 00:12:13,096
Outrageous! I'll teach you a lesson!

269
00:12:14,020 --> 00:12:16,062
Help... Help...

270
00:12:16,850 --> 00:12:18,797
Kenichi, the truth has finally come out!

271
00:12:20,063 --> 00:12:21,613
Yan...

272
00:12:26,373 --> 00:12:28,291
"Instant Cure"

273
00:12:34,804 --> 00:12:36,740
Kemumaki is such a jerk!

274
00:12:36,780 --> 00:12:39,603
Kemumaki, you're awful!

275
00:12:42,669 --> 00:12:45,580
Hey... Put some muscle into it! Haven't you eaten?

276
00:12:46,128 --> 00:12:47,658
How can you massage someone with so little strength?

277
00:12:47,685 --> 00:12:49,245
You're completely useless!

278
00:12:50,632 --> 00:12:51,902
Hurry up and switch seats!

279
00:12:54,654 --> 00:12:55,460
Kenichi

280
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:57,397
Bullying Kemumaki just because he's so honest

281
00:12:57,437 --> 00:12:59,166
That's wrong, you know?

282
00:12:59,207 --> 00:13:00,800
No, teacher, that's not true!

283
00:13:04,516 --> 00:13:07,530
- Catch me and I'll give you a red date!
- Kemumaki, give it back!

284
00:13:07,916 --> 00:13:10,263
Let's show everyone your score!

285
00:13:11,006 --> 00:13:13,807
Kemumaki... Kemumaki!

286
00:13:14,965 --> 00:13:16,099
Teacher...

287
00:13:16,530 --> 00:13:18,080
Teacher, please don't scold him

288
00:13:18,121 --> 00:13:19,339
It was all my fault

289
00:13:19,380 --> 00:13:21,260
Kenichi Mitsuba, how could you do this?

290
00:13:21,547 --> 00:13:23,088
Picking on an honest kid again, huh?

291
00:13:23,268 --> 00:13:25,008
You've got it wrong!

292
00:13:25,308 --> 00:13:28,715
I didn't bully Kemumaki, he bullied me!

293
00:13:29,373 --> 00:13:31,720
This is maddening, I wasn't bullying him!

294
00:13:34,707 --> 00:13:35,988
Oh, it was just a dream?

295
00:13:36,028 --> 00:13:37,044
What a relief

296
00:13:37,264 --> 00:13:39,114
But as soon as I get to school, I'll see Kemumaki

297
00:13:39,162 --> 00:13:40,561
And he'll bully me again

298
00:13:42,304 --> 00:13:44,157
Just thinking about him gives me a headache

299
00:13:44,197 --> 00:13:46,290
I'm too terrified to go to school

300
00:13:46,484 --> 00:13:47,570
Yan...

301
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:49,910
Kenichi, it's time, hurry up and get out of bed

302
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,560
Yan...

303
00:13:52,601 --> 00:13:55,393
Kenichi, what's wrong?

304
00:13:56,126 --> 00:13:59,266
Kenichi, if you don't get up soon you'll be late

305
00:13:59,307 --> 00:14:01,340
Ouch, my head hurts

306
00:14:01,381 --> 00:14:02,887
Ow, my stomach hurts too

307
00:14:02,927 --> 00:14:04,352
Ow, I think I have a fever too

308
00:14:04,393 --> 00:14:06,220
Then how are you feeling?

309
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,831
Do you need me to call a doctor to look at you?

310
00:14:07,872 --> 00:14:08,779
No need, no need

311
00:14:08,819 --> 00:14:11,010
I think if I just rest for a day I'll be fine

312
00:14:11,051 --> 00:14:13,318
Alright... then get some rest, okay?

313
00:14:13,358 --> 00:14:15,869
Once you feel a bit better, I'll bring you something to eat

314
00:14:16,074 --> 00:14:17,680
It hurts so much...

315
00:14:21,650 --> 00:14:22,819
Matsushita

316
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:23,593
Here

317
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:25,027
Kenichi Mitsuba

318
00:14:26,546 --> 00:14:28,389
Where's Kenichi? Didn't he come to school?

319
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:29,638
Kenichi Mitsuba

320
00:14:30,217 --> 00:14:31,300
Yes, Teacher

321
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:34,211
I heard Kenichi Mitsuba is sick and took the day off

322
00:14:34,394 --> 00:14:37,019
That rascal, he was full of energy just yesterday

323
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:37,760
Teacher

324
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:40,667
I'm really worried about him, I'd like to visit him after school

325
00:14:45,648 --> 00:14:46,781
Yan...

326
00:14:46,954 --> 00:14:47,833
Hattori-kun

327
00:14:47,874 --> 00:14:50,222
A patient should lie in bed and rest quietly

328
00:14:50,262 --> 00:14:51,337
You shouldn't be reading books

329
00:14:52,142 --> 00:14:53,836
Faking sick is really exhausting

330
00:14:53,982 --> 00:14:55,076
Kenichi

331
00:14:55,199 --> 00:14:57,364
Kemumaki is here, he wants to visit you

332
00:14:57,405 --> 00:14:59,207
Oh no, Kemumaki?

333
00:14:59,841 --> 00:15:01,566
Kenichi, how are you doing?

334
00:15:01,607 --> 00:15:03,558
Ow, my head hurts so much

335
00:15:03,599 --> 00:15:04,960
My stomach hurts too

336
00:15:05,001 --> 00:15:06,207
My whole body hurts

337
00:15:06,247 --> 00:15:08,679
I don't want to see Kemumaki, tell him to get lost

338
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,862
Mom, hurry up and tell him to get lost

339
00:15:10,903 --> 00:15:11,745
Get lost...

340
00:15:11,786 --> 00:15:14,061
Mom, Kenichi is fine now

341
00:15:14,102 --> 00:15:15,929
He was totally fine just a moment ago

342
00:15:16,178 --> 00:15:18,309
No, I'd better get a doctor to examine him

343
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:20,425
Is Kenichi really that sick?

344
00:15:20,655 --> 00:15:22,493
Yes, I'm really sorry

345
00:15:22,533 --> 00:15:24,723
Auntie, I'm really worried about him

346
00:15:24,763 --> 00:15:27,205
Why don't I go bring a doctor over, okay?

347
00:15:27,246 --> 00:15:28,151
Huh, really?

348
00:15:28,192 --> 00:15:30,649
Kemumaki, we're really troubling you then

349
00:15:31,986 --> 00:15:33,488
Come on, hurry, this way

350
00:15:36,078 --> 00:15:38,035
Staying at home is so boring

351
00:15:39,700 --> 00:15:41,050
Could they be looking for me?

352
00:15:45,355 --> 00:15:46,698
Oh no, this is awful

353
00:15:46,739 --> 00:15:49,363
Who's messing with me and called an ambulance?

354
00:15:52,565 --> 00:15:53,940
If you're faking being sick, Kenichi...

355
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:55,790
The best is yet to come

356
00:15:57,073 --> 00:15:59,200
One, two...

357
00:15:59,241 --> 00:16:01,448
Where is the dying patient?

358
00:16:01,489 --> 00:16:03,639
Mom, I'm completely all better now

359
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:05,815
Look, I can exercise, I'm totally fine

360
00:16:05,876 --> 00:16:08,730
One, two...

361
00:16:09,046 --> 00:16:10,863
I'm really so sorry

362
00:16:11,488 --> 00:16:13,176
Kenichi isn't actually sick

363
00:16:13,217 --> 00:16:15,342
In fact, he was faking it

364
00:16:16,062 --> 00:16:18,616
Faking an illness? He really is lazy!

365
00:16:18,738 --> 00:16:21,227
Why don't you leave this matter to me?

366
00:16:21,268 --> 00:16:24,141
All right, we'll find out why he faked being sick

367
00:16:25,937 --> 00:16:28,402
Who was awful enough to call an ambulance for me?

368
00:16:28,442 --> 00:16:30,323
Mom almost yelled at me because of that!

369
00:16:30,363 --> 00:16:31,374
Kenichi

370
00:16:31,756 --> 00:16:33,252
Kenichi, I was worried about you being sick

371
00:16:33,293 --> 00:16:34,821
So I called a doctor over

372
00:16:34,862 --> 00:16:37,233
I told you, I'm already all better!

373
00:16:37,274 --> 00:16:38,740
Still, just to be safe...

374
00:16:38,780 --> 00:16:40,260
It's better to let the doctor examine you

375
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:42,116
Now, there's no need to fear the doctor

376
00:16:44,205 --> 00:16:46,410
Come on, take off your shirt

377
00:16:51,737 --> 00:16:53,758
It's nothing, a quick shot and you'll be fine

378
00:16:53,799 --> 00:16:56,140
Wait, you're giving me a shot?

379
00:16:56,181 --> 00:16:58,139
Oh no, I'm really fine!

380
00:16:58,180 --> 00:17:00,089
No... Help!

381
00:17:00,130 --> 00:17:01,836
Hey, don't run away!

382
00:17:03,389 --> 00:17:05,820
Let's see if Kenichi ever dares to fake being sick again

383
00:17:05,860 --> 00:17:07,788
Don't give me a shot!

384
00:17:07,828 --> 00:17:09,037
Don't run away!

385
00:17:09,078 --> 00:17:12,743
Help... No...

386
00:17:13,514 --> 00:17:14,909
Huh, what's going on?

387
00:17:14,950 --> 00:17:16,981
If you don't get a shot, you won't get better!

388
00:17:17,022 --> 00:17:17,935
Hey, don't run away!

389
00:17:17,975 --> 00:17:20,006
Strange, that doctor's wearing straw sandals

390
00:17:20,047 --> 00:17:21,683
Turns out he's an Iga ninja?

391
00:17:21,724 --> 00:17:22,922
He's my arch-rival

392
00:17:26,475 --> 00:17:27,757
Running all the way here, I think...

393
00:17:27,983 --> 00:17:30,352
I think I should be safe now...

394
00:17:33,597 --> 00:17:35,218
Help! No!

395
00:17:35,259 --> 00:17:37,634
Don't give me a shot! This is bad!

396
00:17:39,689 --> 00:17:41,435
No, please don't!

397
00:17:41,783 --> 00:17:42,984
Concealed weapons!

398
00:17:47,018 --> 00:17:48,208
He got away!

399
00:17:48,535 --> 00:17:49,521
Kemumaki!

400
00:17:49,828 --> 00:17:50,772
Kemumaki

401
00:17:51,295 --> 00:17:53,803
Kemumaki, did you just rescue me?

402
00:17:53,843 --> 00:17:55,400
Oh, thank you so much!

403
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,292
Kemumaki, thank you so much!

404
00:17:57,333 --> 00:17:59,978
I'm sorry, I always thought you were bullying me

405
00:18:00,018 --> 00:18:02,320
Now I realise that I was in the wrong

406
00:18:02,361 --> 00:18:03,178
Say what?

407
00:18:03,218 --> 00:18:05,940
No matter what, I won't skip class tomorrow!

408
00:18:05,981 --> 00:18:07,970
Kemumaki, thank you!

409
00:18:08,010 --> 00:18:11,487
-I'm so touched... Thank you!
-Yeah... Please don't cry

410
00:18:11,528 --> 00:18:13,677
I can't stand it when people cry

411
00:18:16,620 --> 00:18:20,084
This problem is finally solved, Yan...
